   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "The Imperial Silver is created for those who appreciate timeless elegance with a refined, contemporary touch. Its 39mm stainless steel case offers clarity and restraint, enhancing the design without excess. Balanced in presence and proportion, it suits both formal settings and meaningful occasions. The guilloché dial blends shades of blue and white, enhanced by a hand-applied enamel layer that brings depth and quiet refinement. A round date window at the six o’clock position adds a practical yet understated detail, while the engine-turned chapter ring introduces a vintage note that complements the dial’s intricate texture. Mineral glass protects the watch with clarity and durability, keeping the design crisp from every angle. The handcrafted lizard leather strap completes the piece with natural sophistication. At 20mm wide, it wears light and elegant, pairing seamlessly with the dial’s character. The Imperial Silver stands out through precision rather than shine. A stainless steel statement defined by balance and refinement, designed for the moments that matter.",
