   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "The Imperial Gold is created for those who appreciate timeless elegance with a refined, contemporary touch. Its 39mm case features a warm gold-tone finish that adds a subtle richness without overpowering the design. Balanced in presence and proportion, it suits both formal moments and meaningful occasions. The guilloché dial blends shades of blue and white, enhanced by a hand-applied enamel layer that brings depth and quiet refinement. A round date window at the six o’clock position adds a practical yet understated detail, while the engine turned chapter ring introduces a vintage note that complements the dial’s intricate texture. Mineral glass protects the watch with clarity and durability, keeping the design crisp from every angle. The handcrafted lizard leather strap completes the piece with natural sophistication. At 20mm wide, it wears light, elegant and comfortably, pairing seamlessly with the dial’s character. The Imperial Gold stands out through presence rather than shine. A gold-tone statement that elevates your look and belongs on the occasions that matter.",
