   "priceMinor": 49500,
   "currency": "EUR",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Revealing its mechanical soul through a fully openworked skeleton design, the Phantom Noir embraces darkness with purpose. Beneath sapphire crystal with a subtle blue AR coating, the movement appears to float - a quiet choreography of gears suspended in shadow. Every detail is framed by a matte-black 38 mm case, refined and minimalist, allowing the open architecture to command attention without excess. The open caseback extends the experience, turning the watch into a 360-degree study of mechanical depth. Paired with a supple, high-comfort rubber strap, the Phantom Noir delivers both presence and practicality in a design built for everyday wear. The result is a timepiece defined by contrast: bold yet understated, intricate yet effortless. A watch that reveals more the longer you look. PHANTOM NOIR — a shadow with a heartbeat.",
